Error [E0355]: `apply` received an invalid callable policy: `nope` is not a callable policy; use one of cache, retry, trace, registration, route
  --> tests/ui/callable_policy_invalid.jet:6:17
    |
  6 |     selected :: apply(nope(1), load)
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: policy values are checked before application and cannot change a callable's signature
 Fix: use `cache(…)`, `retry(…)`, `trace(…)`, `registration(…)`, or `route(…)`
